4	line	Barbarian guard	I have the perfect challenge for you... The Alfred Grimhand Barcrawl! First completed by Alfred Grimhand.
4	box	The guard hands you a Barcrawl card.
4	line	Barbarian guard	Take that card to each of the bars named on it. The bartenders will know what it means. We're kinda well known.
4	line	Barbarian guard	They'll give you their strongest drink and sign your card. When you've done all that, we'll be happy to let you in.
4	action	end
